(7179307, 1103069, 86447, '<td valign="top">With the hand coming from the camera''s direction, this appears to be "selfie"... and those lend an air of "cellphone-not-professional-shot" to an image.   I think that''s probably hurting your votes.<br/> <br/>I hate it when I don''t have another person to help me so I don''t have to do this... so I usually set the timer on my camera and then pose as if I weren''t the photographer.<br/> <br/>But, that''s just one opinion.  :D<br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'With the hand coming from the camera''s direction, this appears to be "selfie"... and those lend an air of "cellphone-not-professional-shot" to an image.   I think that''s probably hurting your votes. I hate it when I don''t have another person to help me so I don''t have to do this... so I usually set the timer on my camera and then pose as if I weren''t the photographer. But, that''s just one opinion.  :D (commenting only)', '2014-02-20 14:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
