(7181444, 1102780, 144365, '<td valign="top">Well, the title and post processing doesn''t help.<br/>I really dislike the use of glow. It looks completely unnatural on his face, especially the right cheek. It also makes the shirt have a weird sheen. The expression is comical, but not in a "ha-ha" funny way. It looks entirely contrived, which it obviously is, but I don''t like it.<br/> <br/>So yes, I think this deserved a two.<br/>Since you sent me a PM thanking me for the vote, I gave 14 entries a score of two, so no, I''m not singling you out with low votes.</td>', 'Well, the title and post processing doesn''t help.I really dislike the use of glow. It looks completely unnatural on his face, especially the right cheek. It also makes the shirt have a weird sheen. The expression is comical, but not in a "ha-ha" funny way. It looks entirely contrived, which it obviously is, but I don''t like it. So yes, I think this deserved a two.Since you sent me a PM thanking me for the vote, I gave 14 entries a score of two, so no, I''m not singling you out with low votes.', '2014-02-25 21:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
