(7181577, 1103072, 58667, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=125134" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lyra</a> and I will be praying for her (and you).<br/> <br/>Good question about what would you do with 2 years left - for me I wouldn''t change a thing, except to try harder to spend more time with family and friends (which I already do). This because I try to live every day as if it is my last or one of my last. (Oh, there is one thing - I would pray more). I write this because often one will read the "what would you do if you had x years left" thing, but the truth is I am living pretty much like that and it is definitely possible. Just do it!<br/> <br/>The movie About Time also has this message and puts it well into perspective.<br/> <br/>Oh, congrats on the ribbon! It''s a beautiful image. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-26 01:56:11.</i></td>', ' Lyra and I will be praying for her (and you). Good question about what would you do with 2 years left - for me I wouldn''t change a thing, except to try harder to spend more time with family and friends (which I already do). This because I try to live every day as if it is my last or one of my last. (Oh, there is one thing - I would pray more). I write this because often one will read the "what would you do if you had x years left" thing, but the truth is I am living pretty much like that and it is definitely possible. Just do it! The movie About Time also has this message and puts it well into perspective. Oh, congrats on the ribbon! It''s a beautiful image. :)', '2014-02-26 01:55:20.000000', '2014-02-26 01:56:11.000000', 0),
