(7181616, 1103072, 147314, '<td valign="top">First of all congrats on the Yellow. An amazing beautiful and colourful image.<br/>As for your friend, really sorry to hear this. I don''t believe in praying anymore but I really hope that the time she still has left may be blessed with love and friendship!<br/>And for me, ever since my best friend died on the age of 36, I lived my life as if it could end any day. Enjoy life whenever you can is my life''s motto.<br/> <br/>Thank you for sharing all this!</td>', 'First of all congrats on the Yellow. An amazing beautiful and colourful image.As for your friend, really sorry to hear this. I don''t believe in praying anymore but I really hope that the time she still has left may be blessed with love and friendship!And for me, ever since my best friend died on the age of 36, I lived my life as if it could end any day. Enjoy life whenever you can is my life''s motto. Thank you for sharing all this!', '2014-02-26 03:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7181644, 1103054, 153374, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments and the votes. I have been trying to make sure that the challenges I do can in some way help me learn of this wonderful hobby. I havent been able to crack the top ten but as I learn more and more, I know I will someday :)</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments and the votes. I have been trying to make sure that the challenges I do can in some way help me learn of this wonderful hobby. I havent been able to crack the top ten but as I learn more and more, I know I will someday :)', '2014-02-26 04:19:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7181647, 1103054, 153374, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cutout:</b></div><hr/><i> love the visible string  8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, I made sure it was the only thing visible. Unfortunately, I didn''t know how much processing was allowed, so that is why you can still see on the underside of the wing near the back edge where the transparent fishing line was used. In order to hide it better I painted the fishing ling line with a black sharpie. worked great.</td>', 'Originally posted by cutout: love the visible string  8   Yeah, I made sure it was the only thing visible. Unfortunately, I didn''t know how much processing was allowed, so that is why you can still see on the underside of the wing near the back edge where the transparent fishing line was used. In order to hide it better I painted the fishing ling line with a black sharpie. worked great.', '2014-02-26 04:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
