(7181679, 1103072, 35086, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image which deserves that YR.<br/> <br/>And what you wrote is so inspiring.  I do live everyday of my life like it was my last, every conversation I have with my fiancee, I have it as if it were my last and and my son... nothing is more important than taking in every single moment I have with him.<br/> <br/>I like how you say ''really listen'', that''s something I''ve been telling people lately, to stop and really take in the sights and sounds, not just to be there but to BE THERE.<br/> <br/>Like you are there for your friend.  :)<br/> <br/>Congrats and I wish courage and happiness to you and your friend in this difficult period.</td>', 'Wonderful image which deserves that YR. And what you wrote is so inspiring.  I do live everyday of my life like it was my last, every conversation I have with my fiancee, I have it as if it were my last and and my son... nothing is more important than taking in every single moment I have with him. I like how you say ''really listen'', that''s something I''ve been telling people lately, to stop and really take in the sights and sounds, not just to be there but to BE THERE. Like you are there for your friend.  :) Congrats and I wish courage and happiness to you and your friend in this difficult period.', '2014-02-26 07:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
